# Phase 65 (R7, D-13/D-17/D-18): per-locale rescue-isolated reconcile batch
# driver. Matches the sig/jobs/*.rbs convention (RefreshLegislatorsCacheJob)
# — ActiveJob classes have no AR-generated accessor surface, so there is no
# rbs_rails-generated counterpart under sig/rbs_rails/app/jobs/ (that
# directory has zero precedent for jobs in this codebase).
class ReconcileUserDistrictsJob < ApplicationJob
  def perform: (Integer sway_locale_id) -> void
end
